// Test setup: lp_t_new, then the font layer started and the face cache seeded with Liberation Sans Regular at 9, 16, 32 and 18 px (12 pt is 16 px, 24 pt is 32 px, a 12 pt superscript is 9 px and a 24 pt one is 18), so layout in a case never asks the machine for a font.
